{
  "id": "ACT.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Vatumwa 16",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Paolo yaduuka ha Deribe na Lusitura. Yaali yo mwigizwi uwalangwa Timateo. Mama weve yaali Muyuda Mukristayo navuzwa baba weve yaali Muguriki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timateo yaali ni lizominywa lilahi hagati ha avaamitu va Lusitura na Ikoniamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paolo yenya Timateo azie harara naye mu logendo, na kigira yaga yamukeva. Yakola ndio kigira Avayuda vosi avamenya hazana yaho vamanya ndi baba wa Timateo yaali Muguriki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa yaali niyavitaa mu madaala yago, vahaana ku vandu avasuuviri malago avatumwa na vakulundu vaali mu Jerusalemi vahaana nivavavoolera vagagumiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa makanisa gameeda kuva zinguru mu lisuuvira, ni livaliza lia vandu vasuuvira liameeda madiku goosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paolo yalora amalola mu Turoasi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vavitira muvivala via Furija na Galatia, kigira Roho Mutakatifu siyavavugilira vilwaze likuva yilio mu kivala cha Asia mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa vaduuka ku lwako lwa Misia, vageriza kwingira mu kivala cha Bizinia, navuzwa Roho wa Yeso siyavavugilira mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa vavitira Misia, vazia vulungi nivaduuka Turoasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvudiku yivwo Paolo yalora malola ndi aloli mundu mulala watura Makedonia usingiyi yo na amugoonya, “Yambuka, uzi Makedonia okokonye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonoho lwa Paolo yaali niyakalola malola yago, kwetegeka kuzia Makedonia vugira kulindagira, kigira kwamanya ligali ndi Nyasaye yaali kulindagira, kigira kwamanya ligali ndi Nyasaye yaali nakulangi kuzia kwilwaze Ivangeri kuvandu va Makedonia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lieganira lia Lidia ha Filipi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura Turoasi kwanina mu liato, nikuzia kuduuka Samoturake, na mugamba gwalonda ku kwazia Neapolisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura uwene yeyo kwazia ni kuduuka ha Filipi, lidaala linene lio losoma lwu kutanga lwa Makedonia, kandi liveeye lidaala liamifwa na Varumi. Kwamenya mu lidaala yilio madiku manyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lidiku lie Lisabato kwatula ichova wi lidaala, nikuzia ku lujinga lwu mugera, ha kwaganagana ni havundu hu kusaala. Kwikala nikomoloma na avakali avavugana ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulala ku yavo avakuhulira yaali Lidia, kutura mu lidaala lia Ziatira, yaali mukoli wi viasara vie zinguvu zie rangi ya muzambarao. Yaali mukali uwaasigamiraa Nyasaye. Mwami yakunura mwoyo gwigwe kuhulira icha Paolo yavoola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyima wu mukali oyo harara navinyumba yeye vaali nivakabatizwa, yakwingiriza navoora, “Hambi mumenye munyumba yange niiva mumali kolola ndi mbeeye musuuviri wiligali mu Mwami. Yakogoonya kuzie naye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paolo na Sila muvuhambe ha Filipi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lidiku lilala, lwa kwaali nikuzizaa havundu hu kusaala, mukaana mulala uwaali ni lidemoni liu kulagula, yagana ni kunyi. Mukaana oyo yaleeteranga avatugi veve mabese manyingi ku vulaguli vwivwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa, mukaana oyo yalonda Paolo ni kunyi, nahanzuka, na avoora, “Avandu yava vaveeye avatumwa va Nyasaye Oveeye Yigulu Ligali. Vamwilwazira kuli munyala kohona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamenya na akolaa ndio amadiku manyingi, kuduuka lidiku lilala Paolo yavihilirwa nagirung'ana navolera lidemoni yilio, “Ngulaga ku lieta lia Yeso Kristo, tula muye!” Lidemoni yilio liatura ing'inga yeyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa Avatugi vu mukaana oyo valora ndi lisuuvira liavo lio konyoora vindu via mbeti ligoti, vagumira Paolo na Sila, nivavakulula kuvahila mu chiitu, imbiri wa avanene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vavayaala ku vakalagi, nivavoora, “Avandu yava ni Vayuda, na vakogoyanyiraa lidaala lietu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vigiza miima jitaveeye ja kunyi avandu va Rumi kutavugilirangwa kujikola anoho kujilonda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiduma chahambana harara mu lingilira Paolo na Sila. Avakalagi yavo vatandulira Paolo na Sila zinguvu ziavo, nivahaana malago vakuywi ni zimbimbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa vamala kukuywa nu kukindukizwa ligali, vaviikwa muvuhambe. Mulindi wu muvuhambe yahevwa malago avalindi vudinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolondekana ku malago yago, musikari oyo yavavika munyumba yu mugati ligali, kandi yavoha virenge viavo ku zitiru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimbi vudiku hagati, Paolo na Sila vaali nivasaara nivimba zinyimbu ziu kwizominya Nyasaye, na avahambe vandi nivavahuliriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonoho haali ni lidegera linene lie lirova, nilidengeyiza misingi ju vuhambe, viliango viosi vigulika, ni minyororo jaavoholoka nijitonya kutura ku vahambe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa Musikari wu vuhambe yavuka mu zindoolo, yalora viliango viu muvuhambe nivialami. Yaganagana ndi avahambe viiruki. Kunangwa yasomola kivavi chiche niyenyaa kwiyita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa Paolo yahanzuka nu mwoyo munene na avoora, “Uteekola kindu kidamanu mba. Kunyi kwosi koveeye hano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa yamala kulanga mundu aleete itaya, musikari oyo yingira mu vwangu, naagwa hasi, nasigama ha virenge via Paolo na Sila, na adegera nu vuti vonene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma yavaleeta ichova, navateeva, “Avami, ngola ki, nduuki kohonywa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navo vaamutivulira, “Usuuviri Mwami Yeso, na ivi ulahonywa harara navinyumba yooyo vosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku, vaamwilwazira likuva liu Mwami harara na avinyumba yeeye vosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musikari oyo yavavugula ing'inga zana yu vudiku, naavogiza zingwagu ziavo; inyima vabatizwa ahene nahene yaho, oyo harara na avinyumba yeeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma, yavugula Paolo na Sila navahira munyumba yeeye, navaha viukulia. Oyo harara na avinyumba yeeye vasangala ligali, kigira vaali nivamali kusuuvira Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa vwacha mugamba, avakalagi vatuma avasikari vaavo, nivavavoolera, “Vohololi avandu yavo vazie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musikari wu muvuhambe yavolera Paolo amakuva yago, “Avakalagi vatumi lilaga kovora ndi muvohololwi. Kalunu tuli, muzie ni mirembe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa Paolo yavoola, “Vamali kukukuya imbiri wa avandu kandi vakuviiki muvuhambe nikukikiri kuyaalizwa na kunyi na vandu va Rumi. Ku kalunu vakukunga mbuvisi! Si ganyalika mba! Kuduuka vaze aveene vakovoholole.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avasikari yavo viranyia amakuva yaga ku avanene vaavo, navo lwa vahulira ndi Paolo na Sila vaveeye Avarumi, vaatia ligali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa, vazia kuvateeva zimbavasi, na lwa vamala kuvatuliza, vavagoonya vatuli mu lidaala yilio vazie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paolo na Sila vaatura mu nivazia munyumba ya Lidia. Valolana yo na avasuuviri vache vaavo; na lwa vamala kuvaleminya mioyo, vaatura nivazia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kivihiri mu Tesalonike kutura ku Lilwaza lia Paolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
